 "review": {
  "management_type_reason": "MBG・品種: 高温多湿の夏に株が衰えたら切り戻す。早春に刈る（RHS は枯れ葉を梳き取る）。stauden.de: 花後の茎を切る。株分けは2〜3年ごと（RHS は3年ごと）なので D にしない",
  "management_type_quote": "Clumps may decline in hot, humid summers, and should be cut back if such occurs.",
  "management_type_by_matching": "C 夏前切戻型",
  "heat_west_only": "弱",
  "muggy_west_only": "弱",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/種] 耐暑性；強\n[MBG/品種] Plant foliage may decline considerably in hot, humid summers.\n[NC State/種] Short-lived ornamental grass that does not tolerate hot or humid conditions.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（品種・種の記述）は 弱 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: West-facing or East-facing or South-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 0／MBG・品種] clumps do not spread outward very much（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／stauden.de・品種] Rückschnitt vor der Samenreife um Selbstaussaat zu vermeiden（読み直し）\n[こぼれ種 1／stauden.de・品種] Rückschnitt vor der Samenreife um Selbstaussaat zu vermeiden\n[地下茎 0／MBG・品種] Mass densely (plant 8-10\" apart) when planting as a ground cover since clumps do not spread outward very much and weeds may grow between clumps if spaced too far apart.\n[増え方] こぼれ種・地下茎の段階に合わせて直した（前：株立ち）",
  "mixing_evidence": "地下茎 0〜1（こぼれ種・地下茎の根拠の列）",
